# ── Go ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Binaries (root-level agent binary and any bin/ output dirs)
/cmd
**/bin/
*.exe
*.exe~

# Test & coverage
*.test
*.out
coverage.html
coverage.txt

# Go workspace local overrides (go.work.sum is committed; local sum is not)
go.work.local

# ── Protobuf generated code (optional — uncomment if you prefer to regenerate)
# proto/gen/

# ── Environment & secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12

# ── Docker ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.docker-data/
docker-compose.override.yml

# ── OS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# ── IDEs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Misc ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
tmp/

# ── Generated plan artifacts (docs/) ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Sources (.md, .mmd) and rendered PNGs are committed; these are regenerated via
# docs/assets/render.sh + the Marp CLI. The PDF is published as a Release asset.
docs/**/*.svg
docs/**/*.pptx
docs/aws-plan-slides.pdf
